I don't have a C compiler (on the blasted Window$ machine I'm stuck
with at the moment), so I don't do patches. But the various
Gehennom-altering patches I have read about seem merely to add more
fixed demon-lord levels, which I *don't* like. The randomness of
Nethack means that you feel like you're playing a new game every time;
the more levels there are that are always the same, the less it feels
that way.
