The item or intrinsic-granting something would have to be guaranteed,
but not necessarily in one place. It could be coded something like the
portal to Ludios: a range of levels within which it *could* be found,
a chance of creation on any of those levels, and once it's created, no
more chance of it being created later (or maybe there could be more
than one). It could simply appear randomly or have a chance of being
generated in specific places (like BoHs and AoRs). IOW, it's
guaranteed to be there, but not in any specific place where you'd know
where to look.
>
>Intrinsicwise... in mythology heroes going into the underworld had to face
>hard restrictions, like not looking back (okay, maybe I'm mixing something
>up), and not answering to the spirits calling. Some kind of challenge like 
>this would be nice. 

A particular challenge, like getting past the Sirens, is definitely
the type of thing I'm looking for. 

>Other ideas have been preventing food generation, 
